#N canvas 40 40 900 520 modal-in 0;
#X text 20 20 modal <text> -- sticky. Cleared by modal-off \, or by the safety TTL in pd layers if that never arrives., f 52;
#X obj 20 110 inlet;
#X obj 20 150 list append;
