#X obj 20 250 s \$0-on-modal;
#X text 20 350 The trigger reads right to left \, so: clear the text \, write the new text \, then raise the layer. A modal carrying no text therefore shows nothing rather than the PREVIOUS modal's text., f 58;
#X connect 1 0 2 0;
#X connect 2 0 3 0;
#X connect 3 2 4 0;
#X connect 4 0 5 0;
#X connect 3 1 6 0;
#X connect 3 0 7 0;
