#N canvas 40 40 900 500 defaults 0;
#X text 20 20 COLD START. Nothing has arrived on disp yet \, so without these the home screen would try to draw three empty lines -- and pd text-out would correctly refuse all three \, leaving a blank display that looks exactly like a dead patch., f 58;
#X obj 20 140 loadbang;
#X obj 20 180 t b b b;
#X msg 20 240 L 0;
#X msg 200 240 R 0;
#X msg 380 240 cut-it v0.2;
#X obj 20 290 s \$0-txt-l;
#X obj 200 290 s \$0-txt-r;
#X obj 380 290 s \$0-foot;
#X text 20 360 The levels overwrite L 0 and R 0 within a tenth of a second of DSP starting. The footer keeps cut-it v0.2 until u_init reports its first boot stage., f 58;
#X connect 1 0 2 0;
#X connect 2 2 3 0;
#X connect 2 1 4 0;
#X connect 2 0 5 0;
#X connect 3 0 6 0;
#X connect 4 0 7 0;
