#X obj 620 520 s \$0-text;
#X obj 900 470 list prepend 2 31 16;
#X obj 900 520 s \$0-text;
#X text 20 580 y 0-7 name \, 8-23 value \, 23-30 name \, 31-46 value. 46 is the last row the param area owns -- the meter strips start at 48 -- so the second value ends exactly one row clear of them., f 58;
#X connect 1 0 2 0;
#X connect 2 1 3 0;
#X connect 3 0 4 0;
#X connect 4 0 5 0;
#X connect 5 1 6 0;
#X connect 6 0 7 0;
#X connect 7 0 8 0;
#X connect 6 1 9 0;
